{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"parser 已经保留了 height。但注意一个 bug：`height: Math.abs(tx[3]) || t.height * viewport.scale` —— `tx[3]` 是变换矩阵的旋转分量（通常是 0），所以 height 实际用了 `t.height`，正确。

现在写富文本重建模块。核心算法：
1. 按 y 排序、x 排序
2. 对每个文字项，如果后面紧跟一个字号明显更小（<70%）、y 偏移在 ±1~4pt、x 紧邻的项，就合并为 `父_子`（下标）或 `父^子`（上标）
3. 合并 x 相邻且同 y 同字号的断开词（如 `ET` + `T`）

注意：这个重建只用于 **LLM prompt 中的表头候选**，不改规则引擎的行列聚类（那已经工作正常）。实际上更好的是把重建后的文字写成一张"标头行文本"给 LLM。

我写一个函数 `reconstructCells(cells)` 返回带 richText 的 cells。"},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-bbe80d75049eb35a","toolName":"write_to_file","args":{"filePath":"f:\ai-tool-projects\pdf-table-extractor\lib\pdf\richtext.ts","content":"import type { TextCell } from './parser';

export type RichCell = TextCell & { richText: string };

const SIZE_RATIO = 0.75;
const MAX_SUBSCRIPT_GAP = 5;

function isSubscript(a: TextCell, b: TextCell): boolean {
  if (b.height <= 0 || a.height <= 0) return false;
  if (b.height >= a.height * SIZE_RATIO) return false;
  const dy = b.y - a.y;
  if (dy < 0 || dy > MAX_SUBSCRIPT_GAP) return false;
  const gap = b.x - (a.x + a.width);
  return gap >= -2 && gap <= 3;
}

function isSuperscript(a: TextCell, b: TextCell): boolean {
  if (b.height <= 0 || a.height <= 0) return false;
  if (b.height >= a.height * SIZE_RATIO) return false;
  const dy = a.y - b.y;
  if (dy < 0 || dy > MAX_SUBSCRIPT_GAP) return false;
  const gap = b.x - (a.x + a.width);
  return gap >= -2 && gap <= 3;
}

function isSplitWord(a: TextCell, b: TextCell): boolean {
  const dy = Math.abs(a.y - b.y);
  if (dy > 2) return false;
  if (Math.abs(a.height - b.height) > 1.5) return false;
  const gap = b.x - (a.x + a.width);
  return gap >= -1 && gap <= 2;
}

export function reconstructRichText(cells: TextCell[]): RichCell[] {
  const sorted = [...cells].sort((a, b) => a.y - b.y || a.x - b.x);
  const result: RichCell[] = [];
  let i = 0;

  while (i < sorted.length) {
    let current = sorted[i];
    let text = current.text;
    let j = i + 1;

    while (j < sorted.length) {
      const next = sorted[j];
      if (isSubscript(current, next)) {
        text += `_{${next.text}}`;
        current = { ...current, width: next.x + next.width - current.x };
        j++;
        continue;
      }
      if (isSuperscript(current, next)) {
        text += `^{${next.text}}`;
        current = { ...current, width: next.x + next.width - current.x };
        j++;
        continue;
      }
      if (isSplitWord(current, next)) {
        text += next.text;
        current = { ...current, width: next.x + next.width - current.x };
        j++;
        continue;
      }
      break;
    }

    result.push({ ...current, richText: text });
    i = j;
  }

  return result;
}

export function richCellText(cells: TextCell[]): string {
  return reconstructRichText(cells)
    .map((c) => c.richText)
    .join(' ');
}
