{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我加两个修复：
1. `Column N` 占位符 → 空字符串
2. 合并单元格向下填充：如果某列只有第一行有值、后续行该列为空，且这是数值/短文本列，就向下填充（但要小心——这可能误伤真正的空白单元格）

第二个要谨慎。PRD 说"无法确定不静默修改"，所以合并单元格填充应该**加警告**而非静默。但用户希望数据正确。我采用保守规则：只在"连续多行相同列全空且首行有值"时填充，并加警告让用户复核。

其实更安全的是：不填充数据，而是加一个明确的警告"Column X may have merged cells; verify rows below"。但用户截图里明确希望 Grinding 行显示 0.9611。

我选择填充+警告。实现："},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-812034d2db95e44d","toolName":"replace_in_file","args":{"filePath":"f:\ai-tool-projects\pdf-table-extractor\lib\llm\fallback.ts","old_str":"function normalizeTable(t: z.infer<typeof LLM_TABLE>) {
  let headers = t.headers.map(cleanCellText);
  let rows = t.rows.map((row) => row.map(cleanCellText));

  // Drop trailing empty cells that LLMs often append (false columns).
  rows = rows.map(trimTrailingEmpty);
  headers = trimTrailingEmpty(headers);

  const dataCols = Math.max(0, ...rows.map((r) => r.length));
  const colCount = dataCols > 0 ? dataCols : headers.length;

  const normalizedHeaders = headers.slice(0, colCount);
  while (normalizedHeaders.length < colCount) normalizedHeaders.push('');
  const normalizedRows = rows.map((row) => {
    const r = row.slice(0, colCount);
    while (r.length < colCount) r.push('');
    return r;
  });

  return { ...t, headers: normalizedHeaders, rows: normalizedRows, columnCount: colCount };
}","new_str":"function normalizeTable(t: z.infer<typeof LLM_TABLE>): { table: z.infer<typeof LLM_TABLE>; mergedColumns: number[] } {
  let headers = t.headers.map(cleanCellText).map((h) => (/^column\s+\d+$/i.test(h.trim()) ? '' : h));
  let rows = t.rows.map((row) => row.map(cleanCellText));

  rows = rows.map(trimTrailingEmpty);
  headers = trimTrailingEmpty(headers);

  const dataCols = Math.max(0, ...rows.map((r) => r.length));
  const colCount = dataCols > 0 ? dataCols : headers.length;

  const normalizedHeaders = headers.slice(0, colCount);
  while (normalizedHeaders.length < colCount) normalizedHeaders.push('');
  const normalizedRows = rows.map((row) => {
    const r = row.slice(0, colCount);
    while (r.length < colCount) r.push('');
    return r;
  });

  // Detect vertically merged cells: first row has a value, all following rows empty in same column.
  const mergedColumns: number[] = [];
  if (normalizedRows.length >= 2 && colCount > 1) {
    for (let c = 0; c < colCount; c++) {
      const first = normalizedRows[0][c]?.trim() ?? '';
      if (!first) continue;
      const restEmpty = normalizedRows.slice(1).every((r) => !r[c]?.trim());
      if (!restEmpty) continue;
      mergedColumns.push(c);
      for (let r = 1; r < normalizedRows.length; r++) normalizedRows[r][c] = first;
    }
  }

  return {
    table: { ...t, headers: normalizedHeaders, rows: normalizedRows, columnCount: colCount },
    mergedColumns,
  };
}","explanation":"修复 Column N 占位符并检测/填充纵向合并单元格。"}}]}

