{"requestId":"3ffbd02a88df4e118fd3581f61354927","modelId":"hy4flash","modelName":"Hy4 flash","isHelperMessage":false,"traceId":"30c1a87ebefc797183f7161b1b4bc64c","toolStatus":{"chatcmpl-tool-a5b526d51166168c":{"ready":true,"status":"executed","args":{"filePath":"f:\ai-tool-projects\pdf-table-extractor\lib\llm\fallback.ts","offset":248,"limit":70},"result":{"status":"success","success":true,"result":{"type":"read_file_result","path":"f:\ai-tool-projects\pdf-table-extractor\lib\llm\fallback.ts","content":"   248:/**
   249: * Correct the parent (topmost) header line using the PDF's text coordinates.
   250: * LLMs often mis-place multi-level group labels (e.g. putting "Diversity" over
   251: * 4 columns and dropping "DPG"). The coordinates determine column centres
