修改 `extractPageWithLlm`："},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-95cba4d60cf3c69b","toolName":"replace_in_file","args":{"filePath":"f:\ai-tool-projects\pdf-table-extractor\lib\llm\fallback.ts","old_str":"  try {
